{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1363,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd6e305e08a0fa27673a0cc4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算头上没有绑一字巾，\r\n但心里的一字巾始终牢牢绑着！\r\n今天也要全力以赴朝梦想迈进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1104a4faa767013220531e1f4b12b89683e4284a95e028d0f08c583f3a97bebf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc50548307e38ff747ccc11e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拿出比盛夏的柏油路\r\n更为炽热的意志！\r\n齐心协力上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2a10ed304b372966806d5f7907878cf96f72d74642f47d15cdb5605e92d064f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbeed73edd698e43d0eb4799",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "度假就跟竞赛一样！\r\n都是由最乐在其中的人获胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcc11099153f7d1f7e432d9a89eddbdb377c9fdb13f50ca168a135d6a75deafc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10ddd62a022af00fe22bf86f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在训练员陪伴下，\r\n会抵达什么样的未来呢！？\r\n真是一趟令人期待万分的旅行啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90cb920d1ead5fcf3982676eef4c1252e2bb94d83aaf704cde6f338c162ff44c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21136ac0cd8611c54910ec2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我之所以能走到这一步，\r\n全是多亏训练员的热情指导！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "efc2f2a604100341e3081bdc0a8ff45626766fdda25f291121e52f633a70b4d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5b28e91704f3b02dde142ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以礼为始，以礼为终……！！\r\n我有好好做到吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c78135706d18b45392802292f964b4be2861e4b44e0f93f49d37d5113ab2d0d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d52db1d4d6dd350a7db4cd54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这趟旅途中高潮迭起，\r\n玩得真是超级开心的呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "509d4092b17ad493946417d47da9082b8f0c87d03aa8c66eb1d656d9bc458f35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e680e427d55d1676f19644a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你带给我这么棒的回忆！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f9bac2a39245ee2470b4e83ece003b82456c13ecf4bb2da2a5cde9ff9aca64b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2166c7b44eae015cf732123e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还不够！！我还要继续精进自己！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "443f74f08fa822bffa42d559358c12025022f5ebe637a5caf15433a696bc7425",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac74de7e13f2c6f26a913b79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔喔喔！！我要超越自己！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f2e9bc5d5e60b91d4c1a539a57b93c312117317d69d572cae68f1d104f8ff09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4299b343c68b8cab6c445336",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你好！！我是青竹回忆！！\r\n请多指教！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4d962c668a5d976410b9c9f50dd77e951cb1ae76b84fe7997268acbc53a0ceb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ed90353c926e77a9bfb01f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谁都无法阻止我的满腔热血，\r\n以及我的梦想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84558a0a7ddfea6914cd40aa7c9f677f5d92bbe175f74db074e68022945f6723",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a21f6e795d0b1611c5f0d0f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多依靠我一点也没关系的喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "710d31c6eeaf1a4c566c5710f1aa11ab9cf2c55064a629e432c0a2c6e7567944",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aedc648ce437f345b7ebc205",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会突破自己的极限！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e61ddded983f609c453ccf0693447d6ef6e091ca0e251652dc0904b1c5ab004",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b99b918e1d0a8adb404f8c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又～能继续朝新的地方前进了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02e439e6da93119fe36609d08a438b14665612d5eaf918140c0635957656b297",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44f56bdf9be496270ba78319",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在有所成长后，\r\n就朝下个目标迈进吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b2ab5171ca5819301dbd3757880ef7768e79631c74875b6e3423a83fa6d668a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b49af8325290440df6c5ce4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该玩的时候就要好好玩！\r\n这也是遵守纪律的一环！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cd681208c18c1d5a87eafbb1a30987dc60264c2eb522c73b9508d9b5eecbc58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af4a85312b56b2eba81b1a83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "青竹回忆已经准备万全！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27d2058717546643a62695e7b8de01c36d30af31f00255941facb77b399fa69b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd45bbd336b3a5d0b7711e0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出動だー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ce1f8c17b648079306a59b4a2efe6ed0c9e65ce9543091a7b641b4fe1bad998",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45722b4e89abbf423ca226ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アタシはまだちっちゃいし\r\n実力もまだまだだけど…誰かに\r\n勇気をあげることは、できるんだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab182740df4007760662bb90f2ed81edb23c8949486b897d5cd97488c11261c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:381c13c1b9e4325c64d8e767",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるぞー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "51857d73a0a094ff239fb224d805d0781f50b429051a5726af3fdf8ef79d2a93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b1e4f13f28743c7478bcbbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戻ったぞー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cf085ecc0a09a7b26e7b4db151b847f81fda6b9bdef1cc403654b11e1fc2d85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e919a58880d5198e8951ea4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アタシとオマエはヒーロー同士、\r\n共に正義を志す仲間だ！力を\r\n合わせれば、できないことはない！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ec5f3bf15b39ca10547944413267faee6530b52ac21b8130cf4317f83d8ae68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1149731bb960b9e7f9418f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "仲間を信じて支え合えるのが\r\n真のヒーローなんだな。へへへ…\r\nつらい時は、また頼ってもいいか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a4049e291ccb14766993e244e88423c52a3791f1eb795d6a86a076bc8da1ea5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a35690cc184797871ba121d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お年玉もらったから、一緒に\r\nおもちゃ屋の初売りに行こうぜ！\r\n変身アイテムゲットだっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e18e1649774b1e74e38258b4123fb0fcafeb415b056c4384b2da7afd7b2a35da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a2225ed5261695fa2c29521",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "キャロットマンはチョコになっても\r\nカッコいいな～！少し多いけど…\r\nあ！よかったら一緒に食べないか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d93da93e4ad6de30e2d47042faa6836b9edb0daa7a6cfbc748d9dc197b52653",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d8be26ac76fdf14ff9bef52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ボノに習ってチョコ作ったんだ！\r\n『テンパ・リ～ング！』って技で\r\n美味しくできたぞ！食べてくれっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9db4ddf48156367655a65e924714d77073f50697f9a7c0518ece446bc751238",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4966d62ee15e8910d23179e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "七夕の短冊、竹を登っててっぺんに\r\n飾ったぞ！木登りは得意なんだー！\r\nオマエのも飾ってきてやろうか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e66ca227c3287b2c793b4a056ce2aece34e8bd079a1adf5b5674e81fa2c2c31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffeb5a47b737ad026081a305",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日はあちこちに怪人がいる！？\r\n…って、ビックリしちゃったぞ！\r\nへへっ、今年も平和でなによりだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c097975ec33bdd733c33dde8eb499d52758d34d659e1fb3d27afed45c20c4135",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bc7c73ddbf31ccd9139d26c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "キャロットマンのクリスマスブーツ\r\n今年もすごいんだぞっ！もちろん、\r\nトレーナーのぶんもあるからな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82eb9abd4b09e45cc2a0ad69630a77bd0672544a7a0c06e2a67b69248301b4a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94e3ec8c8ebbbe68ccc581d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "キャロットマンケーキもいいけど…\r\n今日はオマエが好きなのを買うぞ！\r\n一緒にパーティーするんだからな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbfe49e5174824f5942449d15619f69627d850d05a7f22159879dece722e04dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e18cebaaf3fcba8aad26004f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝ったー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0be3dba272222c738052e31f3179dd5f22fbbece4cde2cd53c4b166ae4d7b0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee55eda849cd13840566fecc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "年末年始は特番でニチアサの番組が\r\nお休みだけど…こういう時こそ、\r\n配信で過去シリーズをイッキ見だ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6880d52e0a791a327e08578c3d13f07534030301c4b6e0473b5a554e61317e16",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa2388ef1163c2782c4eec82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナー！誕生日おめでとう！\r\n今日はオマエが主役だぞ！\r\nヒーロー役も譲ってやるっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5e8b71e31a432400bcbc8c0aaba3611e2497be591dabd5b539a1cc60969af05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21a94c3fad5dea62f41955f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "誕生日なんだから、してほしい\r\nことがあったらなんでも言えよな！\r\nなんでもいいぞ！絶対叶えてやる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a58c91399b232d7f35818c4f7b42864defee7e571d99a5e1e0635bb301328d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4ada1643e9a59209ffb0d7a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "誕生祝いにみんながすごいヒーロー\r\nショーの企画を考えてくれたんだ！\r\nアタシ主役で、バーン！ってさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "38254c738361655b1bde1aa08eeaa18ec4702db8afdc00727333d606900ac9ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1c8524908d5d74c4fadbf74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "オマエも祝ってくれるんだな、\r\n1つ、大きくなったアタシを…！\r\nへへへ♪もっともっと祝ってくれ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aadb1536e9ff3869c18c1656c6125e5345592ab82328608260b9aac6e3c48ca9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f3cc13f758bfe04af1f0395",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "む！お知らせが来てるぞ。\r\nよい子は忘れずにチェックだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "db54fcc1d08949c1c63363d4e0c25bc356978ba006d640878ec101094198956d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcb5d19c94966c4e4d4721c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "プレゼントが届いてるぞー！\r\n新しい武器か？パワーアップした\r\n変身アイテムか！？早く開けよう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "afe3879f35077371b34036b5a46768d4852c33b3dcfaa926b2a7269308027020",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4e8e976a4f77e00f3c87e52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やったな！ミッションクリアだ！\r\nトレーナーも、\r\nまたひとつ強くなったんだな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5403f281b355945d1c53bc27e261498c1f98a5fbe58eebac0c597573f33855b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:512df96bd850481ed5cf3bb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なあなあっ、\r\nイベントの『次回予告』、見たか？\r\nアタシ、すっごく気になるぞーっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d7cfb0e7ff61bd965ed72ba96804faf145523d895e9bfc8b68c24c81d4fb300",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3532787da8a11011da26e330",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベントが開催中だっ！\r\n目いっぱい盛り上げて、\r\n一緒にヒーローになるぞー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a16f404c5fe890daf4191c76d1b11472a039203fbcaa54f2152223c27dcea091",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:241d816f1fae0b4abac6ec1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "くそう…！",
